      "description": "Chamada de download no encerramento.",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-button-primary\" href=\"https://github.com/tulerws/Lume/releases/latest\">Download Lume <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3v12m-5-5 5 5 5-5M5 16v4h14v-4\"/></svg></a>",
      "css": ".ds-button-primary{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;box-sizing:border-box;gap:32px;min-height:58px;padding:16px 24px;font-family:Manrope,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;border-radius:6px;background:var(--ink,#18231b);color:var(--white,#f4f5ee);transition:background .3s,transform .3s var(--ease,cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1));}.ds-button-primary:hover{background:#344631;transform:translateY(-2px);}.ds-button-primary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--focus,#66834c);outline-offset:6px;}.ds-button-primary svg{fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.5;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;flex-shrink:0;width:22px;height:22px;transition:transform .4s var(--ease,cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1));}.ds-button-primary:hover svg{transform:translate(2px,-2px);}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-button-primary,.ds-button-primary svg{transition:none;}}"
