    {
      "name": "Recursos compartilhados",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "shared-features",
      "description": "Lista de definição do capítulo escuro, com recursos comuns aos dois modos.",
      "html": "<dl class=\"ds-shared-features\"><div><dt>Stay aware.</dt><dd>Live status, activity and the moments that need your attention.</dd></div><div><dt>Stay in control.</dt><dd>Conversations, permissions and context, with controls supported by each agent.</dd></div><div><dt>Move work forward.</dt><dd>Review results and connect steps through workflows with clear handoffs.</dd></div></dl>",
      "css": ".ds-shared-features{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:60px;margin:0;padding-top:28px;border-top:1px solid #354739;background:var(--night,#101d17);color:var(--night-text,#e4eadf);font-family:Manrope,sans-serif;}.ds-shared-features dt{font-size:18px;margin-bottom:14px;}.ds-shared-features dd{margin:0;max-width:310px;color:#a7bba9;font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;}@media(max-width:1100px){.ds-shared-features{gap:28px;}}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-shared-features{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:26px;}.ds-shared-features dt{font-size:17px;margin-bottom:8px;}.ds-shared-features dd{max-width:100%;font-size:13px;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Mapa de arquitetura",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "connection-map",
      "description": "Versão estática do mapa planejado. A trajetória da página responde à rolagem por app.js.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-connection-map\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Planned architecture: Lume, Relay and Node; direct local-network access is also planned.\"><svg class=\"ds-connection-lines\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 260\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path class=\"ds-route\" d=\"M200 120H1000\"/><path class=\"ds-direct\" d=\"M200 120v90Q200 235 230 235H970Q1000 235 1000 210V120\"/></svg><div class=\"ds-point\"><span class=\"ds-symbol ds-client\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i></span><strong>Lume</strong><span>Orb + Workspace</span></div><div class=\"ds-point\"><span class=\"ds-symbol ds-relay\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><strong>Relay</strong><span>Encrypted transport</span></div><div class=\"ds-point\"><span class=\"ds-symbol ds-node\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><strong>Node</strong><span>Your paired machine</span></div><span class=\"ds-direct-caption\">Direct local network</span></div>",
      "css": ".ds-connection-map{position:relative;min-height:330px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);padding-top:10px;background:var(--connected,#d1dac8);color:var(--ink,#18231b);font-family:Manrope,sans-serif;}.ds-connection-lines{position:absolute;left:0;top:0;width:100%;height:260px;fill:none;overflow:visible;}.ds-route{stroke:#81986a;stroke-width:1;vector-effect:non-scaling-stroke;}.ds-direct{stroke:#a1b092;stroke-width:1;stroke-dasharray:3 5;vector-effect:non-scaling-stroke;}.ds-point{display:grid;justify-items:center;align-content:start;position:relative;gap:9px;text-align:center;}.ds-symbol{width:98px;height:98px;position:relative;display:grid;place-items:center;background:var(--connected,#d1dac8);margin-bottom:18px;}.ds-symbol i{position:absolute;display:block;border:1.5px solid #587344;}.ds-client i:first-child{width:60px;height:40px;border-radius:4px;transform:translate(-8px,5px);background:var(--connected,#d1dac8);}.ds-client i:last-child{width:36px;height:19px;border-radius:20px;transform:translate(13px,-22px);background:var(--connected,#d1dac8);}.ds-relay i{width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:50%;}.ds-relay i:first-child{transform:translateX(-15px);}.ds-relay i:last-child{transform:translateX(15px);}.ds-node i{width:50px;height:28px;border-radius:4px;background:var(--connected,#d1dac8);transform:translateY(17px);}.ds-node i:first-child{transform:translateY(-17px);}.ds-node i:nth-child(2){transform:none;}.ds-point strong{font-size:32px;line-height:1.2;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:-.03em;background:var(--connected,#d1dac8);padding-inline:15px;}.ds-point>span:last-child{font-size:12px;color:#4c6041;background:var(--connected,#d1dac8);padding-inline:15px;}.ds-direct-caption{position:absolute;top:248px;left:0;right:0;text-align:center;color:#546749;font-size:11px;}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-connection-map{min-height:310px;}.ds-point strong{font-size:25px;padding-inline:7px;}.ds-point>span:last-child{max-width:110px;font-size:11px;padding-inline:5px;line-height:1.5;}.ds-symbol{transform:scale(.78);margin-bottom:0;width:84px;}.ds-connection-lines{height:230px;}.ds-direct-caption{top:244px;}}@media(max-width:480px){.ds-point strong{font-size:22px;}.ds-point>span:last-child{max-width:96px;}}@media(max-width:359px){.ds-symbol{width:73px;}.ds-point strong{font-size:20px;}.ds-point>span:last-child{max-width:87px;}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Presença que se expande",
    "overview": "Uma base mineral clara, tipografia ampla e uma abertura de lâminas metálicas tornam visível a mudança de escala. O Orb discreto com terminais independentes e o Workspace em uma janela apresentam duas organizações completas do mesmo monitor de agentes.\n\nAs imagens vêm dos componentes Svelte reais, com sessões ilustrativas identificadas. Luz e perspectiva acompanham as interfaces; texto curto, espaço livre e leitura do produto conduzem a apresentação.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Manrope ampla sobre superfícies minerais.",
      "Contraste noturno no capítulo do Workspace.",
      "Capturas reais, composição editorial e rolagem nativa."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "Same Lume",
        "body": "A mudança entre a base clara e o capítulo escuro apresenta a organização do espaço; Orb e Workspace preservam a mesma hierarquia de capacidades.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "Readable Product",
        "body": "Sombras e perspectiva acompanham as capturas, mantendo texto, legendas e partes essenciais da interface legíveis.",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Apresentar Orb e Workspace como modos completos com as mesmas capacidades, respeitando os limites de cada integração.",
      "Usar capturas reais e identificar as sessões ilustrativas.",
      "Preservar foco visível, navegação por teclado, texto alternativo e conteúdo sem JavaScript.",
      "Manter GitHub, Jira e execução distribuída identificados como “In development”, conforme a documentação do produto."
    ],
